A Two-Night Laboratory Study}
\author{P.~Achebe, D.~Larsen, and M.~Ito}
\date{May 2026}

\begin{document}
\maketitle

\section{Protocol}
Twenty-eight volunteers completed two consecutive nights of
four-hour time in bed, with vigilance testing each morning.

\input{results}

